{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05XM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$G : \\mathcal{X}' \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$1$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$G$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-representable-on-top}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b98f383c1473cffa3bf563cbfaa8d64cbc79345d75f8dff0f149a5e003303de8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:72b0af1ff3625fee5f02b9cf85a3399c2d6189c4e6f9d59a8674415aa8d6dd01", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002>\nbe <MATH_0003>-morphisms of stacks in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nIf <MATH_0005> is representable by algebraic spaces, then the <MATH_0006>-morphism\n<MATH_0007>\nis representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:512d35bdb35e83b50cb40c8b14bc63e34fe009ebebb6fa0814139da9d816a2fa", "unit_id": "tag:05YJ:statement"}
